{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经Deno可疑执行JavaScript。对应需求：执行。官方：Suspicious JavaScript Execution via Deno。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经Deno可疑执行JavaScript","references":["https://reliaquest.com/blog/threat-spotlight-casting-a-wider-net-clickfix-deno-and-leaknets-scaling-threat","https://deno.com/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"ff18d24b-2ba6-4691-a17f-75c4380d0965","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n (process.name : \"deno.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name == \"deno.exe\" or ?process.code_signature.subject_name == \"Deno Land Inc.\") and\n process.command_line : (\"*javascript*base64*\", \"*eval(*\", \"*http*\", \"*javascript*import*\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经Deno可疑执行JavaScript\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.